<section class="testimonials container reveal">
  <h2 class="reveal d1" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px;">住客评价</h2>
  <p class="reveal d2" style="text-align:center;color:var(--muted);margin-top:0;margin-bottom:18px;">古城中心位置，步行可达咖啡馆、寺庙与夜市。</p>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="tcard reveal d1">
      <div class="t-head">
        <div class="avatar"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="name">王同学 · CN</div>
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>位置很棒，离帕辛寺很近。巷子安静，房间干净，老板热心，推荐！</p>
      <div class="meta">入住 2 晚 · 3 月</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tcard reveal d2">
      <div class="t-head">
        <div class="avatar"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="name">Mint · TH</div>
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>网络快，打车备注一键复制很方便，Grab 定位也准确。价格实惠。</p>
      <div class="meta">商务 · 5 月</div>
    </div>
    <div class="tcard reveal d3">
      <div class="t-head">
        <div class="avatar"></div>
        <div>
          <div class="name">Yuki · JP</div>
          <div class="stars">★★★★☆</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p>页面有地图/WhatsApp 快捷按钮，导航很顺利。整体体验不错！</p>
      <div class="meta">情侣 · 7 月</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
